        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to welcome No. 71 Hazelbury Park to the market. This is a stunning TURN KEY three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home with an ideal kitchen extention and outdoor living SOUTH facing rear garden. The property is ideally situated in a quiet development in Clonee, Dublin 15. Hazelbury Park enjoys an excellent location close to a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops and recreational facilities. The property is also ideally positioned for commuters with easy access to the M50 motorway, making travel throughout Dublin and beyond both convenient and straightforward.\nBright and well-proportioned internal accommodation extending to approximately c. 110 sq. briefly comprises an entrance hallway with understairs guest W.C, a cosy living room to the front with open fireplace and a fabulous modern and open plan kitchen extention/dining area to the rear . The extension is flooded with natural light and benefits from excellent fitted storage, a full-sized fridge and freezer, generous kitchen cabinetry and a fantastic sense of space. Large sliding doors open directly onto the sunny SOUTH-facing rear garden, creating a seamless connection between the kitchen and garden and providing the perfect setting for summer entertaining, morning coffees or simply relaxing outdoors.  Upstairs, booasts three well-appointed bedrooms, with master benefiting of an ensuite and stylish main family bathroom completing the upstairs accommodation. Externally, No. 71 benefits of a side entrance from the sunny rear garden towards the generous driveway providing off-street parking for two cars.\nNo. 71 comes to the market in immaculate condition throughout and benefits from a large kitchen extention with a modern touch, wood burner, gas fired central heating, SOUTH facing rear garden, B ber rating for a green mortgage, attic space, side entrance and a large front driveway for 2 car spaces.  This property is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to trade up to their dream home. Given the prime location, excellent condition and attractive setting, we expect this property to be extremely popular. Early viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>Turn- Key Semi-Detached family home</li>\n <li>3 Bed / 3 Bath</li>\n <li>Large open plan & modern kitchen extention/ dining area</li>\n <li>Sunny SOUTH facing rear garden</li>\n <li>110 sq.m</li>\n <li>B BER Rating qualifying of a green mortgage</li>\n <li>Immaculate condition throughout</li>\n <li>Generous driveway with parking for 2 cars</li>\n <li>Wood burner and open fireplace</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Attic space</li>\n <li>Close to schools and shops</li>\n <li>Easy access to the M50 motorway</li>\n <li>Ideal family home</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers and those trading up</li>\n <li>Early viewing strongly advised</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\nEircode = D15 H2N2"
      },
